<QuestionLayout
  title="Does capability publish validate model attribution before the registry write?"
  description="Yes for contract-decidable rules — traverse-cli capability publish rejects bad ai objects offline before any registry Git write (Decision 109 / Spec 056 v1.1.0). Keeps ai verbatim. Evidence digests and rights drift stay registry-CI-only."
  canonical="https://traverse-framework.com/questions/does-capability-publish-validate-model-attribution.html"
